{"3633680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sea of Remnants", "steam_appid": 3633680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/9b53a84275b61864998a6f7542cf6b8b.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/9b53a84275b61864998a6f7542cf6b8b.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend says that beyond the moon lies another sea—a place where all questions are answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sailor opens their eyes once more, will they see the glass bottle floating in magenta currents, or the butterfly perched on a rusted mast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea of Remnants, you play a sailor who has lost all memory, embarking on a strange and wondrous ocean voyage alongside a mysterious girl, hoping to recover what was forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Ship of Stubborn Souls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor sets out without hoping to reach the Sea of Remnants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/81589b11cde3e212c2777277254821bd.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/81589b11cde3e212c2777277254821bd.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open-world journey, you'll recruit a crew of diverse puppetfolk allies, build your ship with custom parts and cannons, and assemble teams for exploration and battle. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/41e953b7d9c2587244302228a660822a.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/41e953b7d9c2587244302228a660822a.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you act on impulse or spare your enemies, stay home or chase profit across the currents—your smallest choices ripple outward. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orbtopia: A Pirate's Safe Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor wants to drift forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/3a67413c79b393212e76a37916d61958.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/3a67413c79b393212e76a37916d61958.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbtopia is the liveliest pirate city on the sea. Failed voyages end here—washed back by the tide. Repair your ship, upgrade gear, and prep for the next departure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/10165a04c073bc1674174cadbc11cc0c.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/10165a04c073bc1674174cadbc11cc0c.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, sizzling oil crackles from street stalls, coin pouches jingle from another lucky trade, and someone just lost their last chip at the mahjong table. Tackleboxes snap shut with a clatter—who’s glaring green-eyed at the angler now? There, cats rule the alleys. Roosters itch to set sail. A pirate gorilla rises from obscurity. A parrot translates between beast and man. Orbtopia breathes in noise, spice, and a little chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Reckless Voyage Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor faces uncharted waters without awe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/7ab2474c95b82e8251aad83579f9a612.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/7ab2474c95b82e8251aad83579f9a612.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable seas and dynamic weather mean no two journeys are alike. One moment, the skies are calm—the next, a storm splits the heavens. Sea beasts shimmer beneath whirlpools. Leviathans descend through lightning and cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step ashore onto volcanic, jungle, or sun-bleached islands, or uncover eerie ruins and strange tribal grounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cue the Electric Guitar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor dreams of playing it safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/006c2d38c93f1ff31302b3793d59e472.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/006c2d38c93f1ff31302b3793d59e472.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on real ocean physics, creature behaviors, and environmental systems, Sea of Remnants blends stylized animated visuals with sharp-edged comic book flair, vibrant graffiti energy, and absurdist glitch aesthetics—a sensory feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight wildly imaginative bosses. Discover eerie legends. Chase mysterious treasures tucked into remote wilderness. It’s a pirate adventure that's wild, romantic, and utterly punk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Endless Loops of Memory and Loss: Every bond you form will resurface at the journey’s end in the Sea of Remnants—a place where memories cost everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ever-Changing Turn-Based Combat: Form your dream pirate crew, train them in hidden professions, and unlock powerful skills to tip the tide of turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The Ocean and the City, Both Punk: Don’t fear failure. Every journey connects a beginning and an end. The harbor is just as punk and romantic as you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/b29768e2c93240e50709a0dc7325f572.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/b29768e2c93240e50709a0dc7325f572.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memories of past voyages flow together as glowing magenta currents, linking every island, sea monster lair, and distant port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another memory bottle sinks into the sea, scattering radiant ripples across the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: all seas lead to one mysterious destination—the Sea of Remnants, where the truth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/fa2ea37aafe4c700b3ee590d3c0a1cb4.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/fa2ea37aafe4c700b3ee590d3c0a1cb4.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/9b53a84275b61864998a6f7542cf6b8b.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/9b53a84275b61864998a6f7542cf6b8b.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legend says that beyond the moon lies another sea—a place where all questions are answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the sailor opens their eyes once more, will they see the glass bottle floating in magenta currents, or the butterfly perched on a rusted mast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sea of Remnants, you play a sailor who has lost all memory, embarking on a strange and wondrous ocean voyage alongside a mysterious girl, hoping to recover what was forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Ship of Stubborn Souls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor sets out without hoping to reach the Sea of Remnants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/81589b11cde3e212c2777277254821bd.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/81589b11cde3e212c2777277254821bd.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this open-world journey, you'll recruit a crew of diverse puppetfolk allies, build your ship with custom parts and cannons, and assemble teams for exploration and battle. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/41e953b7d9c2587244302228a660822a.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/41e953b7d9c2587244302228a660822a.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you act on impulse or spare your enemies, stay home or chase profit across the currents—your smallest choices ripple outward. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orbtopia: A Pirate's Safe Haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor wants to drift forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/3a67413c79b393212e76a37916d61958.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/3a67413c79b393212e76a37916d61958.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbtopia is the liveliest pirate city on the sea. Failed voyages end here—washed back by the tide. Repair your ship, upgrade gear, and prep for the next departure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/10165a04c073bc1674174cadbc11cc0c.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/10165a04c073bc1674174cadbc11cc0c.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, sizzling oil crackles from street stalls, coin pouches jingle from another lucky trade, and someone just lost their last chip at the mahjong table. Tackleboxes snap shut with a clatter—who’s glaring green-eyed at the angler now? There, cats rule the alleys. Roosters itch to set sail. A pirate gorilla rises from obscurity. A parrot translates between beast and man. Orbtopia breathes in noise, spice, and a little chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Reckless Voyage Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor faces uncharted waters without awe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/7ab2474c95b82e8251aad83579f9a612.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/7ab2474c95b82e8251aad83579f9a612.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable seas and dynamic weather mean no two journeys are alike. One moment, the skies are calm—the next, a storm splits the heavens. Sea beasts shimmer beneath whirlpools. Leviathans descend through lightning and cloud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step ashore onto volcanic, jungle, or sun-bleached islands, or uncover eerie ruins and strange tribal grounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cue the Electric Guitar</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sailor dreams of playing it safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/006c2d38c93f1ff31302b3793d59e472.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/006c2d38c93f1ff31302b3793d59e472.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on real ocean physics, creature behaviors, and environmental systems, Sea of Remnants blends stylized animated visuals with sharp-edged comic book flair, vibrant graffiti energy, and absurdist glitch aesthetics—a sensory feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight wildly imaginative bosses. Discover eerie legends. Chase mysterious treasures tucked into remote wilderness. It’s a pirate adventure that's wild, romantic, and utterly punk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Endless Loops of Memory and Loss: Every bond you form will resurface at the journey’s end in the Sea of Remnants—a place where memories cost everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ever-Changing Turn-Based Combat: Form your dream pirate crew, train them in hidden professions, and unlock powerful skills to tip the tide of turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The Ocean and the City, Both Punk: Don’t fear failure. Every journey connects a beginning and an end. The harbor is just as punk and romantic as you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/b29768e2c93240e50709a0dc7325f572.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/b29768e2c93240e50709a0dc7325f572.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memories of past voyages flow together as glowing magenta currents, linking every island, sea monster lair, and distant port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another memory bottle sinks into the sea, scattering radiant ripples across the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: all seas lead to one mysterious destination—the Sea of Remnants, where the truth awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras/fa2ea37aafe4c700b3ee590d3c0a1cb4.avif?t=1787210900\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/extras_big/fa2ea37aafe4c700b3ee590d3c0a1cb4.avif?t=1787210900 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Sea of Remnants is a visually rich ocean adventure RPG. As a puppetfolk sailor seeking lost memories, you’ll brave dynamic seas, battle strange monsters, build your fleet, bond with companions, and shape the evolving pirate city of Orbtopia through every choice you make.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, French, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633680/580ba61ac8ebbc47c64725be35fe751760e93b0a/header.jpg?t=1787210900", "capsule_image": "ht